ocial game, you are your own judge. It is quite impossible to accurately watch where the shuttle lands. Maybe the best choice will be to let the player nearest to the shuttle make the call. <\/p>\n<p>If I am a line judge in a competition, I will consider it IN if the shuttlecock touches the outer edge of the outer line.\n   <\/p>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<p>\n\t <a href=\"if-the-cocks-touches-the-outer-edge-of-the-outer-line-then-it-is-out-or-in-comment-form.html\" class=\"old-comments\">Click here to post comments<\/a>\n         <\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\">\n          <a href=\"in-out-rules-questions.html#INV\" class=\"noplsin\"><br \/>\n              Join in and write your own page! It&#8217;s easy to do. How? Simply click here to return to <b>Questions on In\/Out Rules<\/b>.<\/a>\n          <\/p>\n<h3 class=\"fblikeste\">Like Masterbadminton.com?<\/h3>\n<p\/>\n<div id=\"fb-root\"\/><script><![CDATA[(function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(d.getElementById(id)){return;}js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\"..\/connect.facebook.net\/en_US\/all.js#xfbml=1\";fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}(document,'script','facebook-jssdk'));]]><\/script><like href=\"index.html\" send=\"false\" width=\"450\" show_faces=\"false\"\/>\n<div align=\"left\">\n<like-box href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/How-To-Play-Badminton\/365607500122681\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" show_faces=\"false\" stream=\"true\" header=\"true\"\/>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>by Murali Krishna (Visakhapatnam) Question: If the shuttlecock touches the outer edge of the outer line then it is out or in? AnswerHi Murali. During a competition or tournament, this is usually decided by the line judge. The call may be very subjective and it totally depends on the line judge. However, most of the [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format